{"overview":"یه پری دریایی در عصر جوسون چطور می‌خواد در دوران مدرن امروزی زنده بمونه؟ “شیم چانگ” یه پری دریاییه که خودشو در دوران مدرن امروزی پیدا می‌کنه. او توسط یه آدم سرد و خوش‌تیپ به نام هئو جوون جائه (لی مین هو) که همزاد یه پسر اشراف‌زاده به نام “کیم موو” در سلسله جوسونه گیر می‌افته…","tagline":"","overview_en":"A mermaid from the Joseon period ends up in present-day Seoul, where she crosses paths with a swindler who may have ties to someone from her past.","tagline_en":"How can a mermaid from the Joseon era survive in modern-day Seoul?","runtime":60,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":1,"y":2016,"poster":"/iXHZHH9emaTTgAjyGjUY5aNnxo6.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":20,"y":2016,"poster":"/xDTsUuNAyzW6GZVbDDhPihj4p4A.jpg"}],"episodes":20,"crew":["진혁","박지은"],"crew_en":["Jin Hyuk","Park Ji-eun"],"countries":["PW","KR","ES"],"cast":[{"name":"جون جی هیون","role":"Shim Cheong / Se-hwa","photo":"/qejOQBdIzN18e69yRcsiD0JQi4c.jpg","en":"Gianna Jun"},{"name":"لی مین-هو","role":"Heo Joon-jae / Kim Dam-ryung","photo":"/iqopuz6cKuRZRUPZQrj7lFZcWWb.jpg","en":"Lee Min-ho"},{"name":"이희준","role":"Jo Nam-doo / Park Moo","photo":"/4slyXnHbKgzmeyJNetBSORgDDEF.jpg","en":"Lee Hee-jun"},{"name":"Shin Won-ho","role":"Tae-oh","photo":"/uz1mIUrdzvR8ZsRBWTxff1Rm7uv.jpg"},{"name":"Shin Rin-a","role":"Seo Yoo-na","photo":"/MHYUqgSAn7sSuBWTukBoC5Nof8.jpg"},{"name":"شین هه سون","role":"Cha Shi-ah","photo":"/cuCFjBn3SpWyhIfBy9TupzvTrmp.jpg","en":"Shin Hae-sun"},{"name":"문소리","role":"Ahn Jin-joo","photo":"/iXfIsmrzohNAAf2gyPCE06rJM1N.jpg","en":"Moon So-ri"},{"name":"나영희","role":"Mo Yoo-ran","photo":"/sVuIgKFg7i6MlNapbhmKsCspAC.jpg","en":"Na Young-hee"},{"name":"황신혜","role":"Kang Seo-hee/Kang Ji-yeon","photo":"/qNfBffDdgEqu9AdfLKaGp7gBoSM.jpg","en":"Hwang Shin-hye"},{"name":"오연아","role":"Young Kang Seo-hee/Kang Ji-yeon/Hong Nan","photo":"/jVLJgFBTNEd4v92Z1KM4Yotr2e8.jpg","en":"Oh Yeon-ah"},{"name":"이지훈","role":"Heo Chi-hyun","photo":"/pVFDjFb6prVah1wHtkUiVLEb2VG.jpg","en":